WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
The United States is a federal republic of 50 states spanning North America from the Atlantic to the Pacific.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Denali in Alaska towers at 6,190 meters above sea level as the highest summit in North America.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Yellowstone, established in 1872, is the world's first national park, protecting hydrothermal geysers.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
American roots music pioneered Jazz, Blues, and Country featuring the acoustic guitar and banjo.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Culinary traditions feature slow-smoked barbecue brisket, New England clam chowder, and apple pie.

